        "original_id": "28cddaea-84e8-57a6-8f8c-0b86119a30c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Groff\n- Organizations: Travel Channel\n- Products: \"Vegas Stripped\"\n- Places: South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa; Las Vegas, Nevada; Enterprise, Nevada; Silverado Ranch\n- Topics: hotel and casino operations\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Groff was an executive producer for the Travel Channel show \"Vegas Stripped.\"\n- \"Vegas Stripped\" was a behind-the-scenes look at the operations of the South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa in Las Vegas, Nevada.\n- The South Point Hotel and Casino includes a 25-story hotel tower and a 90,000-square-foot convention center.\n- The South Point Hotel and Casino is located on a 60-acre site along Las Vegas Boulevard in Enterprise, Nevada, adjacent to Silverado Ranch.",
